<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details seeding progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details seeding progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Wednesday detailed the level of seeding progress to May 18. DATE	S. WHEAT  DURUM  OATS  BARLEY  FLAX  CANOLA  ALL*</p>
<p>May 18/97  43 pct   61 pct 13 pct 24 pct  9 pct 24 pct 38 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  39 pct   54 pct 18 pct 26 pct 12 pct 16 pct 35 pct</p>
<p>	    MUSTARD  SUNFLWR LENTIL PEAS  CANARY SEED</p>
<p>May 18/97  36 pct   26 pct 68 pct 50 pct 35 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  25 pct   29 pct 48 pct 37 pct 33 pct</p>
<p>*includes specialty crops</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
